    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-19T21:30:29+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-19T21:30:29+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-19T11:00:29Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-19T11:00:29Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure system in the Bight will drift southeast as the associated trough crosses South Australia overnight and clears to the east by Friday. A weak high pressure system will then move across southern SA from Friday afternoon. A trough and cold front will then move into the west from Saturday evening and cross the rest of SA on Sunday. A high will then push in behind the front and will move across the Bight early next week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW009" description="Flinders" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-19T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-19T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding. Winds northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">The chance of a thunderstorm on and east of the ranges in the early morning. Sunny day. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending west to northwesterly 25 to 40 km/h in the morning then turning south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the afternoon and evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:10pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light before dawn then becoming northwest to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to high 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h increasing to 40 km/h before shifting west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to 21 to 27 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 39.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h turning southerly during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
